      <unicode>ᠴᠠᠯᠠᠬᠠᠢ</unicode>
      <transcript>CALAXAI</transcript>
      <definition>T. hchal ba; S. dur-, dush-, duç:-, duh. Badly, poorly (serves as pejorative prefix). </definition>
      <page>1166</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠠᠯᠠᠬᠠᠢ ᠪᠢᠯᠢᠭᠲᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>+++ -- biligtei;</transcript>
          <definition> T. çes rab hchal ba; S. dushprajna. Of poor perspicacity. </definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠠᠯᠠᠬᠠᠢ ᠱᠠᠭᠱᠠᠪᠠᠳ</unicode>
          <transcript>+++ -- šaγšabad; </transcript>
          <definition>T. tshul hkhrims hchal ba; s. duh-çīla. Of vile morality.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
